 STEP 4 — Update messenger.yaml
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

File: config/packages/messenger.yaml
Change email routing from async to sync:

  framework:
      messenger:
          transports:
              sync: 'sync://'

          routing:
              Symfony\Component\Mailer\Messenger\SendEmailMessage: sync

This makes emails send immediately (not queued).

