 HOW THE FLOW WORKS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  1. User registers  → token generated → verification email sent via Brevo
  2. User clicks link in email  → /verify-email?token=xxxx
  3. EmailVerificationController verifies token → marks isVerified=true
  4. User tries to login → JWTAuthenticationSuccessHandler checks isVerified
     • NOT verified → 403 "Please verify your email"
     • Verified → JWT token returned ✓

  API endpoints:
  POST /api/register              → register + send verification email
  POST /api/verify-email          → verify token (body: {"token":"xxxx"})
  POST /api/resend-verification   → resend email (requires JWT)
  GET  /api/verification-status   → check status (requires JWT)

